# Seed for this clone's .git/info/exclude - SECONDARY, machine-local ignore patterns only.
#
# The PRIMARY home for every shared ignore pattern of the template-branch family (git, ESLint,
# TypeScript, Cursor, ...) is the committed config of the "abstract-javascript-project" branch
# (.gitignore, eslint.config.js, eslint.markdown.config.js, tsconfig.json, .cursorignore), flowing
# into every other branch via the usual template merges - see
# .claude/skills/updating-ignore-rules/SKILL.md.
#
# .git/info/exclude is git's per-clone ignore file (gitignore syntax, never committed, applies on
# every branch, shared by all worktrees of a clone). Use it only for patterns not worth committing:
# personal scratch files, editor leftovers, machine-specific artifacts.
#
# Apply (idempotent; appends only what is missing, never removes):
#     $ node --run setup:git-exclude
# Or by hand: append your patterns to .git/info/exclude directly.

# (no shared patterns - add machine-local ones below)
